                <pb facs="0509" n="416" sameAs="frus:frus1935v04/pg416"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">625.116/25: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Chile</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Scott</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-08-13T19:00:00-04:00">August 13, 1935—7
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>49. Embassy’s despatch 423 of July 31, 1935. You are authorized in your
                    discretion to present to the Foreign Office the note enclosed in the
                    above-mentioned despatch.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
